API List
Type of API	Interface Name	Description	Purpose
PCB	Create order	Submit product process details, Gerber file ID and shipping address to create a PCB order, return order ID, batch number and order type.	Create PCB Orders
	Query order details by batch number	Query order information, shipping address and cost details by the batch number	Query order information
	Get PCB production process information	Submit order ID,track the production process (only available after the order enters production).	Track order production progress
	Get PCB pre-reviw information	Submit Gerber file ID and language type, obtain Gerber file parsing information (PCB length and width, preview image)	Get Gerber file parsing information and use it with the order interface
	Get Stack-up information	Enter the PCB layer, PCB thickness,inner/outer copper thickness and PCB material to query the impedance information that meets the specified conditions.	Obtain impedance information and use it with the order interface
	Upload gerber files	Upload the Gerber file, return the Gerber file ID	Upload Gerber files
	Upload blind slot picture	Upload a blind slot image, return the blind slot image ID	Upload the blind slot picture and use it with the order interface
	Online quote	Submit product process information and Gerber file ID, return process cost information	Get quote
